int bc_debug_step(bc_client_t *c);
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Steps execution to the next command, descending into functions,
subshells, and compound commands.
This is the \(lqstep into\(rq operation.
The function sends a \f[CR]step\f[R] command on \f[CR]CHAN_DEBUG\f[R]
(channel 4).
.PP
After stepping, the debugger stops at the very next command that would
be executed, regardless of nesting depth.
A new break\-hit event is delivered via \f[CR]bc_poll()\f[R] when
execution reaches that command.
.PP
